<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Desc downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Desc downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Monday it had cut its rating on Mexico's Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill cited price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The shares are up 29 percent from the company's July add-on equity financing, and about 20 percent away from our earlier stated price objective of $30,&quot; Merrill said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The diversified company's American Depositary Receipts were unchanged at 24-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
